*> Acceptance test, the raid boss bar (docs/protocol/20 section 14.2; lane 002-lane-mobsb5, T8903): the progress by phase, the name, the Boss Event packets ADD, UPDATE_PROGRESS,
*> UPDATE_NAME and REMOVE to a player and the bar bookkeeping of RAID-BAR-REFRESH.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US15-RAID-BAR.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY BRWORLD.
 COPY RAIDSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-PROGRESS            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(64).
 01 WS-LEN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OP                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WANTED              BINARY-LONG VALUE 9.
 01 WS-EXPECTED            PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTYPE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HIT                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT2               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ONE                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
     MOVE PL-CONN(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-CONN
     MOVE 1 TO RD-USED(1)
     MOVE 77 TO RD-ID(1)
     MOVE 1 TO RD-STATUS(1)
     MOVE WS-DIM TO RD-DIM(1)
     MOVE 1 TO RD-GROUPS(1)
     MOVE 1 TO RD-STARTED(1)
     MOVE 150 TO RD-COOLDOWN(1)
     MOVE 48000 TO RD-TOTAL(1)
*>   Waiting between waves: (300 - cooldown) / 300.
     CALL "RAID-BAR-PROGRESS" USING WS-SLOT WS-PROGRESS
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the bar fills with the cooldown (millionths)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 500000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-PROGRESS TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "RAID-BAR-NAME" USING WS-SLOT WS-NAME WS-LEN
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the name is Raid" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "Raid" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-NAME(1:WS-LEN) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
*>   Fighting: living health over the total; two raiders left name the count.
     MOVE "minecraft:pillager" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-PTYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE PL-X(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-X
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Y
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Z
     PERFORM 2 TIMES
         CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-PTYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-E
         CALL "RAID-JOIN" USING WS-SLOT WS-ONE WS-E WS-ZERO
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE 0 TO RD-COOLDOWN(1)
     MOVE 96000 TO RD-TOTAL(1)
     CALL "RAID-BAR-PROGRESS" USING WS-SLOT WS-PROGRESS
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 two raiders of 24 health out of 96 total is 0.5" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 500000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-PROGRESS TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "RAID-BAR-NAME" USING WS-SLOT WS-NAME WS-LEN
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 two raiders remaining" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "Raid - Raiders Remaining: 2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-NAME(1:WS-LEN) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
*>   The packets.
     MOVE 150 TO RD-COOLDOWN(1)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-OP
     CALL "RAID-BAR-SEND" USING WS-SLOT WS-OP WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 ADD sends the title (2 raiders remaining), progress, red colour and notched_10" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "00000000000000000000000000000065000a08000474657874001b52616964202d20526169646572732052656d61696e696e673a2032003f000000020200" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
*>   UPDATE_PROGRESS carries the float.
     MOVE 2 TO WS-OP
     CALL "RAID-BAR-SEND" USING WS-SLOT WS-OP WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 UPDATE_PROGRESS" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "00000000000000000000000000000065023f000000" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-OP
     CALL "RAID-BAR-SEND" USING WS-SLOT WS-OP WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 REMOVE" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "0000000000000000000000000000006501" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
*>   Bookkeeping: the first refresh adds the bar, the second updates it, dropping the raid removes it.
     MOVE 0 TO RP-BAR(WS-PLAYER)
     CALL "RAID-BAR-REFRESH" USING WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the refresh records the bar on the player" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 77 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RP-BAR(WS-PLAYER) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the refresh sent ADD" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "00000000000000000000000000000065000a08000474657874001b52616964202d20526169646572732052656d61696e696e673a2032003f000000020200" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RAID-BAR-REFRESH" USING WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 the second refresh sends UPDATE_PROGRESS first" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "00000000000000000000000000000065023f000000" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-SLOT2
     CALL "RAID-DROP" USING WS-SLOT2
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 dropping the raid clears the player's bar" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RP-BAR(WS-PLAYER) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 20§14.2 dropping the raid sent REMOVE" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXPECTED
     MOVE "0000000000000000000000000000006501" TO WS-EXPECTED
     CALL "RB-CHECK-HEX" USING WS-CONN TL-CASE WS-WANTED WS-EXPECTED
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US15-RAID-BAR.

 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. RB-CHECK-HEX.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==PK-==.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 65536.
 01 WS-CLOSE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-THRESHOLD           BINARY-LONG VALUE -1.
 01 WS-PACKET-ID           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OUTCOME             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AREA                PIC X(65536) BASED.
 01 WS-COPY                PIC X(512).
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(4096).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-ID                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-CASE                 PIC X(240).
 01 L-WANTED               BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-EXPECTED             PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ID L-CASE L-WANTED L-EXPECTED.
     MOVE "none" TO WS-HEX
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FOUND WS-OUTCOME
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PK-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN" USING L-ID PB-BUFFER WS-CLOSE
     PERFORM UNTIL WS-OUTCOME NOT = 0
         CALL "TEST-NEXT-PACKET" USING PB-BUFFER PK-BUFFER WS-THRESHOLD WS-PACKET-ID WS-OUTCOME
         IF WS-OUTCOME = 0 AND WS-PACKET-ID = L-WANTED AND WS-FOUND = 0
             MOVE 1 TO WS-FOUND
             SET ADDRESS OF WS-AREA TO PK-ADDR
             COMPUTE WS-COUNT = PK-LENGTH - PK-POS
             MOVE SPACES TO WS-COPY
             MOVE WS-AREA(PK-POS + 1:WS-COUNT) TO WS-COPY
             CALL "TEST-HEX-OF" USING WS-COPY WS-COUNT WS-HEX
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PK-BUFFER
     MOVE WS-HEX TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM RB-CHECK-HEX.
